# Ruby boot/title script.
# Frame numbers are emulator VBlank counts, not wall-clock time.
# 520 skips the first intro section; the repeated Start taps sweep the visible title window.
tap 520 Start 6
wait 360
tap Start 8
wait 30
tap Start 8
wait 30
tap Start 8
wait 30
tap Start 8
wait 30
tap Start 8
wait 30
tap Start 8
wait 30
tap Start 8
wait 30
tap Start 8
wait 30
tap Start 8
wait 30
tap Start 8
wait 30
tap A 8
wait 30
tap A 8
wait 30
tap A 8
wait 30
tap A 8
